Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yupo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Choon na ni g-a-choon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Dark Magician is destroyed, and\Nyour life points are almost at zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and that Dark Energy disc will banish\Nyour mind to the Shadow Realm forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already lost by putting your\Ntrust in a scoundrel like Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually believe\Nthat if you defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll reunite you with\Nyour lost love, Catherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, then you're more\Nof a fool than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be together soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick will be so pleased when\NI send Yugi to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And since he helped me construct my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,specifically to counteract\Nthe cards in Yu-Gi's deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcana, why don't you save\Nyourself and set us free? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And ruin the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place one monster\Nface down and end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,remember this is my show,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.37,0:01:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and the grand finale is so close\Nthat I can practically taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I'm a master of\Nmagic, the king of all dark magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even close, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of king would extract the\Nsoul of his very own dark magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You disrespect your cards and rely on\Ntricks to win, but I'll make sure you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't quite hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the hum of the dark energy disk,\Nwaiting to send you to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to kiss your Dark Magician\Ncard and you're mine! Goodbye, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch closely while I pull a\Nstunning victory out of my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, your tricks will have\Nto wait since your turn's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to take\Ncontrol of this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, especially since you have\Nno monsters left to defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my life points are higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I summon Gazelle, the\NKing of Mythical Beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell right into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Shadow Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card makes\Nthe number of monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you have on the field\NEqual to the number I have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I don't have any monsters on the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,field at the moment That\Nmeans you don't either
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That removes my only defense\Nagainst an attack, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When they're gone, I can\Nwipe out your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Dark Magician is destroyed, and\Nyou've got no monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold in my hand the winning card!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to sending your mind to the Shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Realm and getting my sweet Catherine back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was the true\Nmaster of the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And what kind of a master would have\Nonly one Dark Magician in his deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My first one may be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have another Dark Magician, and\Nhe's waiting to destroy you, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I can summon him without sacrificing\Na weaker monster, thanks to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the Dark Magic Curtain! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magic Curtain\Nallows me to summon a high
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-level monster like the Dark\NMagician without a sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,in exchange for one half\Nof my total life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee hee hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on, Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, there's no way you can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, my dueling deck was put together\Nspecifically to counter your strengths!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Its mix of power and magic makes for\Nan unbeatable show, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric will reward me when I\Nhand him your Dark Magician
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,card and tell him your\Nmind's in the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention as My Dark\NMagician wipes out the last of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points and ends\Nyour dueling career forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought the show was good before,\Nyou won't want to miss this ending, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, the final\Nperformance of Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are almost gone and\Nyou have no monsters to hide behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as My Dark Magician\Nattacks, you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,just in case you're counting\Non your two face-down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,cards to rescue you From having\Nto spend all of eternity in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the Shadow Realm I will take\Nthe liberty of wiping them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:06:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Out! And I'll take care of the\Njob with my anti-magic arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your last hope\NSeek and destroy my arrows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've got you completely\Npinned down now, Yugi. The show is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Arcana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magic curtain is working for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you should read\Nthe rules more closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Its magic summoning power is available\Nto both sides of the dueling field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means I can trade half of\Nmy life points for a monster, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like you did, I'll\Nplay another Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told you only had one\NDark Magician in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're partially right,\Nbut mostly misinformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop speaking in riddles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The card that I now hold in my hand is a\Ndifferent variety of Dark Magician Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is even more powerful than\Nyours is. You lie. I'd know if another
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician card existed It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Say hello to Dark Magician Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, a female dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're wrong about one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend's attack\Npoints are less than
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my dark magicians In\Na head-to-head battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster will wipe her out.\NIt's over, Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,attack Dark Magician, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, Yugi's defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.31,0:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Take another look, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician's been beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be\Nmy grand finale. It can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,be he had 500 more attack\Npoints than she did
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,wrong again dark magician girl gains\N300 extra attack points for every
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,dark magician that's inside the card\Ngraveyard arcana making her strong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to defeat your dark magician\Nit still doesn't add up there's only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One Dark Magician card in your graveyard,\Neven with the extra 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Her total is only 2,300.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That means my dark magician\Nstill outranks her by 200 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:08:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were a master of the dark\Nmagician, you would have seen the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of you. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My first dark magician's there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would the power of my Dark\NMagician be reborn in your monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician Girl inherits\Npoints from every Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter whose graveyard it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So when you destroyed your first Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you helped give my Dark Magician Girl the\Npower she needed to destroy your second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Arcana, prepare\Nfor my grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,as I wipe out the last\Nof your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When you mistreat your cards,\Nyou pay a high price. You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto said, "Yugi's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everything all right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's been missing for hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He walked into a tent and disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And my brother traced him to\Nthe basement of this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then we gotta bust\Nin there and rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a dark magician, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your disrespect and\Nyour misuse of your own
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,dark magicians that caused\Nyou to lose this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could\Nhave defeated me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the greatest magician\Nthe world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What I am is very sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you led me\Nall the way down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sole purpose of losing at\Nyour own demented game, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you relied on trickery to win instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,trusting and respecting\Nthe heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark energy disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose, or I'll never get\Nback my sweet Catherine! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The key and a locator card
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bolted shut. Hey, guys,\Nlisten. What's that hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A real magician always has one more\Ntrick up his sleeve Like a spare key
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that I will indeed\Nmake my great escape after all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,it's frozen I can't move my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my hand,\NArcana Master Merrick. You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't hold up your end\Nof the bargain So prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,for your punishment Just\Ngive me another chance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me from the Shadow\NRealm No And you're next, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,please don't send me to the Shadow\NRealm Where's your magic now, fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had the key and now it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your brain playing\Ntricks on you, Arcana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you just lost control\Nof your feeble little mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That key in your hand doesn't really exist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will get you out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.15,0:12:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a cheat like you deserves\Nto go to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done? Catherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My Catherine, please stay and let\Nme make it all up to you. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Merrick is just hiding the real\NCatherine to surprise me with later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Catherine, I need you back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally get married\Nand forget all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcana, are you going to be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcana is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So we meet again, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I need no introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your face to me, Merrick. Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:14:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reveal myself to you when\Nthe time is right and no sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I obtain what's mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know exactly what I\Nwant. The unlimited power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient pharaoh The spirit that lives\Nwithin your puzzle No way, Merrick
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me Remember when\NI took control of Bandit Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost succeeded in separating you\Nfrom the Millennium Puzzle forever No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you were able to put it back together\NBefore you and your spirit friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami, were destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you want Yami's\Npower? Answer me. Because
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that power is rightfully\Nmine And once I have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be unstoppable\NThe world will belong to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,me And no one will stand\Nin the way of my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not you Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me, Merrick Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:15:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi My family has\Nslaved for centuries Protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the tomb of the pharaoh until\Nhis return And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.89,0:15:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be the pharaoh Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get the power of the pharaoh and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it That\Npower belongs to Yami,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,not you Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Yugi, you're nothing\Nbut a vessel for the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh's spirit You could\Nnever comprehend his strength
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor could you stand in my\Nway of getting it. We've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,given up too much to let\Nsomeone else claim the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was raised on the ancient scriptures,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,learning all there is to know about King\NYami the Pharaoh and the Shadow Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to his power is your puzzle\Nand the three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just take the\NMillennium Puzzle from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the ancient scriptures,\NI have to defeat you in a duel first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll banish you to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure you stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I gain control of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and obtain all three Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be king!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And a much more worthy king\Nthan your counterpart, Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even know how to harness the\Ngreat powers that lie dormant within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, know full\Nwell how to take them from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And my Millennium Rod will ensure\Nthat I get everything I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has the cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I already possess two of\Nthe Egyptian god cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know where to find the third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, my loyal team of rare\Nhunters will bring the final card to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of\Ntime, you see. That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,until I take what is\Nrightfully mine and banish you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and the former pharaoh to\Nthe dreaded Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,where you will spend all\Nof eternity while the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of the world is\Nkneeling before King Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the new pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're powerless against me, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My destiny can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see it's only a matter of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The three Egyptian god cards, along with\Nyour Millennium Puzzle, will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will strip the pharaoh of his ancient\Npowers and infuse them within myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep Merrick from\Ngetting all this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew more about Yami's ancient\Npast, because history is repeating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.09,0:17:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's my destiny to help\Nhim save the world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I do know that Merrick can't succeed\Nwithout the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and in order to get it from me,\Nhe has to defeat me in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as I believe in the heart of\Nthe cards and stay connected to Yami,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never defeat me in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll never get your\Ngreedy hands on my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, by the sands of Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the Pharaoh's power will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Another of my mind slaves\Nis already in Battle City,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting to defeat you\Nand take your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And he holds an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's the name of this card?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out soon enough, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Till then, beware the quiet one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the quiet one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you. Next time,\Nshow me your face, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you all right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.49,0:18:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, Yugi! Hey, guys!\NYou're okay? What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will have Yugi's\NMillennium Puzzle and the three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian God Cards And how will\Nyou get Obelisk from Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a simple task.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.59,0:18:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Yugi is taken care of, I'll\Nstrip Kaiba of his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to duel Kaiba yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If it comes to that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But like I said, my first concern\Nis Yugi and his Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep an eye on those friends of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Odeon, they may\Nprove to be quite useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could always use more\Nservants to do my bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the Quiet One\Nto crush Yugi Moto in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,a duel and bring his\NMillennium Puzzle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before\NI possess the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,within which lies the\Nspirit of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll combine the strength\Nof the Winged Dragon of Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the sky dragon and the\Nsoon to be mine obelisk the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,tormentor and in accordance\Nwith the ancient scriptures the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,unlimited power of the pharaoh\Nhimself will belong to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire world will kneel at my feet\Nand no one will be able to stop me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
